3,3286,TRUST Holdings Inc.,不動産関連,不動産・建設,,unknown,92.0,94.0,Industrials,Specialty Business Services,https://www.trust-hd.co.jp,"TRUST Holdings Inc. engages in the parking lot and real estate businesses in Japan. It operates through Parking lot business, Real estate business, Parking Lot Fractionalization Business, Medical service Business, and RV Business segments. The company operates parking lots; offers parking lot management outsourcing services; develops and sells condominiums; and provides real estate rental and brokerage services. It also provides real estate rental, money lending, and various consulting services to medical institutions. In addition, the company operates hot spring facilities; and provides security services. Further, the company manufactures, sells, repairs, and renovates campers; and produces and sells high concentration hydrogen water. TRUST Holdings Inc. was incorporated in 2013 and is based in Fukuoka City, Japan.",ok,https://www.trust-hd.co.jp,トラストホールディングス株式会社 HOME NEWS 企業情報 COMPANY 企業情報 企業情報TOP 代表者挨拶 会社概要 役員紹介 沿革 行動規範 事業紹介 IR情報 INVESTOR RELATIONS IR情報 IR情報TOP IRニュース 株主・投資家の皆さまへ 配当 株主優待 業績・財務ハイライト IRライブラリー 株主総会 株式情報 電子公告 採用情報 RECRUIT 採用情報 採用情報TOP 新卒採用 キャリア採用 NEWS すべて ＩＲ 事業 採用 その他のお知らせ {{news.showdate}} {{news.category_name}} {{news.title}} {{news.title}} NEW READ MORE HOME NEWS 企業情報 - 代表挨拶 - 会社概要 - 役員紹介 - 沿革 - 行動規範 事業紹介 IR情報 - IRニュース - 株主・投資家の皆さまへ - 配当 - 株主優待 - 業績・財務ハイライト - IRライブラリー - 株主総会 - 株式情報 - 電子公告 - ディスクロージャーポリシー 採用情報 - 新卒採用 - キャリア採用 〒812-0016 福岡県福岡市博多区博多駅南五丁目 15番18号 TEL： 092-437-8944 個人情報保護方針 免責事項 反社会的勢力排除の基本方針 Copyright TRUST Holdings Inc. All Rights Reserved.,pending_chatgpt_review,,,,,,
3,3287,"Hoshino Resorts REIT, Inc.",ホテル,内需・消費,,unknown,42.0,40.0,Real Estate,REIT - Hotel & Motel,https://www.hoshinoresorts-reit.com,"Hoshino Resorts REIT, Inc. (hereinafter, HRR) invests in hotels, ryokans (Japanese-style inns) and ancillary facilities. It serves at the core of the tourism industry and for which stable use is expected for the medium to long term. HRR was established under the Act on Investment Trusts and Investment Corporations (Act No. 198 of 1951, as amended; hereinafter, the Investment Trusts Act) with Hoshino Resort Asset Management Co., Ltd. (hereinafter, the Asset Management Company) as the organizer and investments in capital of 150 million yen (300 units) on March 6, 2013. An issuance of new investment units through public offering (19,000 units) was implemented with July 11, 2013, as the payment due date, and the investment securities were listed on the Real Estate Investment Trust Securities Market of Tokyo Stock Exchange, Inc. (hereinafter, the Tokyo Stock Exchange) (securities code: 3287) on July 12, 2013. HRR has steadily expanded its asset size since, bringing the assets held by HRR as of the end of the fiscal period under review to 69 properties (sum total of acquisition price: 226,650 million yen).",ok,https://www.hoshinoresorts-reit.com,"æéãªã¾ã¼ãã»ãªã¼ãæè³æ³äºº æè³æ³äººã®ç´¹ä» å·è¡å½¹å¡æ¨æ¶ æè³æ³äººã®æ¦è¦ æè³æ³äººã®ä»çµã¿ ã¬ããã³ã¹ è³ç£éç¨ä¼ç¤¾ã®æ¦è¦ è³ç£éç¨ä¼ç¤¾ã®çµç¹ æè³æ³äººã®æ¦ç¥ æè³æ¹é éç¨æ¦ç¥ ãã¼ããã©ãªãª ãã¼ããã©ãªãªãµããªã¼ ãã¼ããã©ãªãªããã ãã¼ããã©ãªãªä¸è¦§ è²¡åæ å ± è²¡åæ¹é åå ¥é æå©å­è² åµã®ç¶æ³ æ ¼ä»æ å ±ã»æè³æ³äººåµ åºè³ç·é¡ã»ä¸»ãªæè³ä¸» IRæ å ± ãã¬ã¹ãªãªã¼ã¹ IRã©ã¤ãã©ãªã¼ æ±ºç®ãã¤ã©ã¤ã IRã«ã¬ã³ãã¼ åé éæ å ± æè³ä¸»ç·ä¼ æè³ä¸»ã®çæ§ã¸ ã¢ããªã¹ãã«ãã¬ãã¸ IRã¡ã¼ã«é ä¿¡ç»é²ã®ãæ¡å ãµã