3,3360,"Ship Healthcare Holdings, Inc.",介護関連,医療・ヘルスケア,,unknown,92.0,98.0,Healthcare,Medical Instruments & Supplies,https://www.shiphd.co.jp,"Ship Healthcare Holdings, Inc. engages in the medical, healthcare, welfare, and nursing care businesses in Japan and internationally. It operates through four segments: Total Pack Produce Business, Medical Supply Business, Lifecare Business, and Dispensing Pharmacy Business. The Total Pack Produce segment sells medical devices and medical equipment based on bulk orders, as well as physicochemical; offers consulting services on medicine, healthcare, welfare, and nursing care facilities; operates veterinary hospitals; develops, sells, and maintains medical information systems; builds management business; and leases real estate to medical facilities and other tenants. It also manufactures, constructs, and maintains medical gas piping equipment, operating room interiors, shadowless lights for surgery, rehabilitation equipment, special bathtubs, etc.; and provides renovation services. The Medical Supply segment offers medical supplies and equipment to medical facilities. The Life Care segment operates nursing homes, group homes, and multi-purpose facilities, as well as power rehabilitation facilities; provides meal services; and operates and supports services for day service. The Dispensing Pharmacy segment operates dispensing pharmacies. The company was incorporated in 1992 and is headquartered in Suita, Japan.",ok,https://www.shiphd.co.jp | https://www.shiphd.co.jp/business/ | https://www.shiphd.co.jp/business/tpp/,"シップヘルスケアホールディングス株式会社 ニュース・お知らせ 採用情報 JP / EN 事業内容 事業内容 OUR SERVICE トータルパックプロデュース事業（TPP） メディカルサプライ事業（MSP） ライフケア事業（LC） フード事業（FD） 調剤薬局事業（PH） 新たな取組み 会社情報 企業情報 COMPANY シップヘルスケアグループについて 経営理念・ごあいさつ 会社概要 会社沿革 グループ会社 企業倫理憲章 株主・投資家情報 株主・投資家情報 INVESTOR RELATION 経営方針 トップメッセージ 事業等のリスク 中期経営計画 コーポレート・ガバナンス IRライブラリー 最新資料 決算短信 決算説明資料 有価証券報告書 株主通信 サステナビリティレポート 業績・財務情報 業績・財務ハイライト セグメント情報 主な経営指標 株式情報 株式基本情報 株式の状況 株主還元・配当 株主手続きのご案内 格付情報 株価情