3,3393,"Startia Holdings,Inc.",IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,94.0,98.0,Technology,Information Technology Services,https://www.startiaholdings.com,"Startia Holdings,Inc. engages in the IT business in Japan and internationally. It operates through three segments: IT Infrastructure-Related Business, DX Solution-Related Business, and CVC-Related Business. The company offers digital marketing SaaS products and services comprising marketing automation tools, application creation software, web production and content management system, other digital marketing tools, AR creation software, and document management and e-book creation software that focuses on small and medium-sized enterprise markets. It also provides IT infrastructure products and services, including total support service, copier / multifunction machines, business phone, network construction/maintenance, electricity, optical line / provider, website production / promotion, cloud construction/maintenance, office design, flat-rate printer, office relocation, security camera, commercial air conditioner, LED, air cleaner, and electronic breaker to medium-sized companies. In addition, the company offers indirect operations, such as accounting management, and support operations comprising formulation of investment plans for funds and human resources, as well as engaging in discovering, executing, and counting management, and investment projects primarily in Southeast Asia. Startia Holdings,Inc. was formerly known as Startia, Inc. and changed its name to Startia Holdings,Inc. in April 2018. Startia Holdings,Inc. was incorporated in 1996 and is based in Tokyo, Japan.",ok,https://www.startiaholdings.com,"TOP | スターティアホールディングス株式会社 企業情報 COMPANY 企業情報 代表メッセージ 会社概要 経営理念/ビジョン/ミッション 沿革 グループ会社 役員一覧 健康経営 グループ事業 BUSINESS グループ事業 ITインフラ関連事業 DXソリューション関連事業 その他事業 M&A 株主・投資家情報（IR情報） IR 株主・投資家の皆様へ（IR情報） 中期経営計画 IRライブラリー IRニュース 株式・電子公告情報 English サステナビリティ ESG サステナビリティ 環境（E） 社会（S） コーポレートガバナンス(G) 新着情報 お問い合わせ CONTACT お問い合わせ IRに関するお問い合わせ IR取材に関するお問い