3,3405,"Kuraray Co., Ltd.",全固体電池,自動車・モビリティ,,unknown,8.0,5.0,Basic Materials,Chemicals,https://www.kuraray.com,"Kuraray Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the production and sale of resins, chemicals, fibers, and other-related materials in Japan, the United States, China, Europe, Asia, and internationally. The company operates through five segments: Vinyl Acetate, Isoprene, Functional Materials, Fibers, and Trading. It offers PVOH, PVB, and EVOH resins and films; methacrylic resins; heat-resistant polyamide resins; isoprene chemicals, thermoplastic elastomers; medical and dental products; activated carbon; membranes and systems for water treatment; lipids; PVA and polyester fibers; artificial leather; nonwoven fabrics; hook-and-loop fasteners; CMP pads; and plastic hose. The company is also involved in the manufacturing and sale of molded products; logistics; temporary staffing/recruitment; consulting; travel agency; insurance; and lodging and food service facilities. Its products are used in adhesives and sealants, agriculture and fishery, air and water treatment, architecture and construction, automotive and transportation, clothing and textiles, compounding and materials, electrical and electronics, energy and resources, food and beverage, healthcare and medical, industrial and manufacturing, life and personal care, packaging, paints and inks, and sports and outdoors applications. The company was formerly known as Kurashiki Rayon Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Kuraray Co., Ltd. in January 1970. Kuraray Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1926 and is headquartered in Chiyoda, Japan.",ok,https://www.kuraray.com | https://www.kuraray.com/global-en/company/ | https://www.kuraray.com/global-en/sustainability/3p/psa/,"HOME | Kuraray Skip to main content Global-English Language Navigation Selecting a region changes the language and/or content on Kuraray.com Global Website - English Asia Japan - 日本語 China - 中文 India - English Americas US - English Mexico -