3,3407,Asahi Kasei Corporation,アンモニア,GX・エネルギー,,unknown,8.0,5.0,Industrials,Conglomerates,https://www.asahi-kasei.com,"Asahi Kasei Corporation engages in material, homes, and healthcare businesses in Japan, the United States, China, and internationally. The company offers Pimel, a photosensitive PI material applied for semiconductor applications, such as buffer coating, passivation layers, and dielectric layers; Sunfort, a dry film photoresist; Novacure, a latent curing agent for epoxy resin; glass fabric for printed circuit boards; plastic optical fiber; sensors and devices; artificial suede products under the Dinamica name; Microza UF and MF industrial membranes and systems; Aciplex membranes, process equipment, and systems for caustic soda production; alkaline water electrolyzer for producing hydrogen from renewable energy Aqualyzer; Hipore, a microporous polyolefin sheet which prevents the anode and cathode; Celgard, a lithium-ion battery separator; photopolymers and platemaking systems; and fiber products under the Bemberg, Bemliese, NanoAct, and ROICA names. It also provides cling film, bags, and containers under the Saran Wrap, Ziploc, and Cookper names; packaging products under the Suntec, Barrialon, PVDC latex, and Saran fiber names; pharmaceutical and food additives under the Ceolous and Celphere names; and clads and anchors under the Baclad and AR Chemical Setter names. In addition, the company offers prescription drugs in the fields of orthopedics, critical/intensive care, urology, immune system, and central nervous system; virus removal filters; wearable defibrillators, temperature management systems, pre-hospital, and hospital data management systems; overseas homes, unit homes and apartment buildings, and real estate-related operations; autoclaved aerated concretes, foundation systems, thermal insulations, and structural systems and component products; polymers, monomers, foamed products, and cleaners; and synthetic rubber, elastomers, and intermediates and inorganic chemicals. Asahi Kasei Corporation was founded in 1922 and is headquartered in Chiyoda, Japan.",ok,https://www.asahi-kasei.com | https://www.asahi-kasei.com/company/about | https://www.asahi-kasei.com/company/business,"Asahi Kasei Corporation /content/dam/asahi-kasei/common/videos/HP_AK_Global_15s_260414_Finala_12MB2.mp4 Creating for Tomorrow border false backgroundColor white width full imagePosition left imageCaption true bottomSpacing true buttonPosition center News border false backgroundColor white width full imagePosition left imageCaption true bottomSpacing false buttonPosition center all-pages-en list asahi-kasei:news-fiscal-year/2026 5 false tab-label Show all imagePosition left imageCaption true all-pages-en list asahi-kasei:mgmt-financials,asahi-kasei:news-fiscal-year/2026 5 false tab-label Management / Earnings imagePosition left imageCaption true all-pages-en list asahi-kasei:business-products,asahi-kasei:news-fiscal-year/2026 5 false tab-label Business / Products imagePosition left imageCaption true all-pages-en list asahi-kasei:r-and-d,asahi-kasei:news-fiscal-year/2026 5 false tab-label R&D imagePosition left imageCaption true all-pages-en list asahi-kasei:notice,asahi-kasei:news-fiscal-year/2026 5 false tab-label Notice imagePosition left imageCaption true News border false backgroundColor white width full imagePosition left imageCaption true bottomSpacing true buttonPosition center About us multiple At a Glance /content/asahi-kasei/us/en/company/about Tomorrow's Stories /content/asahi-kasei/us/en/asahikasei-brands/stories Asahi Kasei Report /content/asahi-kasei/us/en/ir/library/asahikasei-report Corporate Promotional Video /content/asahi-kasei/us/en/asahikasei-brands/gallery border false backgroundColor light-gray width full imagePosition left imageCaption true bottomSpacing false buttonPosition center Business Sectors The Asahi Kasei Group operates in the three business sectors of Healthcare, Homes, and Material. Business Sectors He