3,3420,KFC Ltd,建設,不動産・建設,,unknown,91.0,93.0,Industrials,Conglomerates,https://www.kfc-net.co.jp,"KFC Ltd designs and sells construction materials in Japan. The company offers sales and installation of post-installed anchors, and manufacturing and sales of steel materials and various hardware products; sells seismic-related materials; designs and constructs buildings and other seismic-related work, and seismic structures for roads and railway bridge piers; sells civil engineering and construction materials, and electric power tools; and develops and sells inspection and diagnostic products for infrastructure facilities. It also manufactures and sells rock bolts and other tunnel support materials; lock bolt grouting materials, such as dry mortar; sells waterproof sheets and accessories for tunnels, and construction machinery such as melting machines; sells and rents rock solidification agents for tunnels such as urethane injection agents, and construction machinery such as injection machines; import sales, design, and installation of water-impervious sheets and waterproof sheets; sells guardrail repair materials; and environmental countermeasure products. Further, it designs and constructs tunnel interiors and fire-proof works, and sound insulation wall installation; designs and constructs safety facilities, such as protection fence installation work and fall prevention work; and tunnel reinforcement work and building exterior wall repair, tunnel interior lighting and disaster prevention, and facilities related to bridge sections. KFC Ltd was incorporated in 1965 and is headquartered in Kita, Japan.",ok,https://www.kfc-net.co.jp | https://www.kfc-net.co.jp/company/ | https://www.kfc-net.co.jp/company/profile,"株式会社ケー・エフ・シー ニュースリリース ニュースリリース一覧 企業情報 企業情報トップ トップメッセージ 企業理念 会社概要 役員・組織図 KFCの歴史 事業所・連絡先一覧 許可・資格・ISO取得 適用事業所 すぐ分かるKFC R&D／技術開発 サステナビリティ 個人情報保護方針 コーポレートガバナンス 製品・工法 製品・工法トップ 建設用ファスニング資材 トンネル掘削用資材 各種工事・工法 カタログダウンロード 技術情報ダウンロード 動画コンテンツ 製品・工法名からさがす 各種工事 施工事例トップ 工事経歴 IR情