3,3652,Digital Media Professionals Inc.,FA関連,設備投資・機械,,unknown,8.0,5.0,Technology,Electronic Components,https://www.dmprof.com,"Digital Media Professionals Inc. engages in the intellectual property (IP) core license, product, and professional service business in Japan. The company licenses graphics processing units (GPU), and artificial intelligence (AI) related IP products; and develops and sells semiconductors and modules. It also offers low-load and high-precision license plate recognition software products; configurable AI inference processor IP, AI inference processor IP, and small-size image signal processing IP ideal for AI camera systems. In addition, the company provides ZIA C3 SoM, a platform for developing edge devices equipped with AI functions; and ZIA Cloud SAFE, a SaaS type cloud service. Further, it offers professional services, such as safety driving assistance system development, system design, board development, and AI solutions; and 3D and 2D graphics GPU hardware products. The company serves customers in various fields, such as parking lots, factories, offices, hospitals, hotels, public facilities, financial institutions, and retail stores. Digital Media Professionals Inc. was incorporated in 2002 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",ok,https://www.dmprof.com | https://www.dmprof.com/ja/products-and-services/ai-products/cloud-services/driving-assistance/ | https://www.dmprof.com/ja/products-and-services/edge-ai-computing-products/aetina/,DIGITAL MEDIA PROFESSIONALS INC. DIGITAL MEDIA PROFESSIONALS INC. ｜ Making the Image Intelligent 日本語 ENGLISH 製品・サービス 製品・サービス 半導体 RS1 エッジAI向けSoC「Di1」 Di1 SoM Di1 Development Kit Di1 Cam 半導体IP -AIアクセレータIP(NPU IP) NPU「A3000 V2」 NPU「ZIA DV700シリーズ」 -2DグラフィックスIP(2D GPU IP) K3000 ant200 ant100 -3DグラフィックスIP(3D GPU IP) M3000シリーズ ant300 -ステレオビジョン用IP ステレオビジョンIP「ZIA SV」 AIソフトウエア -エッジ向けAIソフトウェア ナンバープレート認識ソフトウエア「ZIA Plate」 ADAS / DMS / 人流解析ソフトウエア「ZIA SAFE」 -SaaS製品 安全運転支援クラウドサービス「ZIA Cloud SAFE」 行動認識AIプラットフォーム「Vision-LLM Insi