3,3687,Fixstars Corporation,IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,94.0,96.0,Technology,Software - Application,https://www.fixstars.com,"Fixstars Corporation operates as a software company in Japan and internationally. It operates through Solution Business and Saas Business segments. The company provides embedded acceleration, image processing algorithm development, distributed parallel system development, GPU acceleration, FPGA systems development, quantum computing, AI and deep learning, automotive software development, and firmware development for flash memory solutions. It also offers Fixstars Amplify, a cloud platform for application development of various Ising machines; Smart Opinion, a telemedical platform for AI-based breast cancer analysis, aiding early detection and promoting women's health; CloneTracker, a tool for managing duplicate code; and Fixstars AIBooster, a GPU cloud service for the development and operations of generative AI and large language models. In addition, the company is involved in the multicore processor related business. Fixstars Corporation was incorporated in 2002 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",ok,https://www.fixstars.com | https://www.fixstars.com/en/company/overview | https://www.fixstars.com/en/products-services,"Speed up your Embedded AI - Performance Engineering | Fixstars Corporation Japanese Contact us Open main menu Home About us Products & Services Case Studies Resources Seminars White Papers Blog News All news Media library IR News IR Home About us Products & Services Case Studies Resources News IR Back About us Message from CEO Company Profile History Access Management Management philosophy Group Companies CSR Technical Publications View List Back Products & Services OVERVIEW What is Performance Engineering? Technology to make systems faster, more cost-effective, and energy-efficient. Fixstars' Strengths Supporting 100+ clients with a 99% repeat rate. Case Studies Enhancing performance for clients across diverse industries. SERVICES Fixstars Vega From building a secure AI development environment to team-wide adoption. AI Model Porting and Optimization for Embedded Systems Maximize AI performance on target embedded hardware. Other services Specialized services for FPGA, quantum computing, flash memory, and other domains. PRODUCTS Fixstars AIBooster Visualizing and optimizing AI processing performance. Fixstars Amplify Quantum computing platform for optimization compatible with all available solvers. Back Resources Seminars White Papers Blog Back News All news Media library IR News Back IR IR News Management Information Corporate Governance Financial Highlights IR Library Stock Information IR Calendar FAQ IR Inquiries Disclaimer View List Message from CEO Company Profile History Access Management Management philosophy Group Companies CSR Technical Publications View List OVERVIEW What is Performance Engineering? Technology to make systems faster, more cost-effective, and energy-efficient. Fixstars' Strengths Supporting 100+ clients with a 99% repeat rate. Case Studies Enhancing performance for clients across diverse industries. SERVICES Fixstars Vega From building a secure AI development environment to team-wide adoption. AI Model Porting and Optimization for Embedded Systems Maximize AI performance on target embedded hardware. Other services Specialized services for FPGA, quantum computing, flash memory, and other domains. PRODUCTS Fixstars AIBooster Visualizing and optimizing AI processing performance. Fixstars Amplify Quantum computing platform for optimization compatible with all available solvers. IR News Management Information Corporate Governance Financial Highlights IR Library Stock Information IR Calendar FAQ IR Inquiries Disclaimer View List Secure AI Appliance For Embedded Development Speed up your AI A secure AI appliance for embedded software development teams Use open-weight LLMs on-premises to improve development efficiency without exposing confidential information. About Fixstars Vega News August 25, 2026 Press Release Fixstars to Support Innovation through the Qualcomm Japan Robotics Center as a Participating Partner from Its Launch August 6, 2026 Press Release Fixstars Amplify SDK Adds Support for AIST’s Japanese-built Quantum Computer “System F” July 29, 2026 Event Upcoming Webinar: “Speed up your Embedded AI” View all news Performance Engineering Performance engineering is the systematic pursuit of software speed and efficiency — translated into business outcomes. Fixstars specializes in AI/LLM training and inference acceleration, GPU utilization improvement, and software optimization. What is Performance Engineering? Products and services for performance engineering Services Fixstars Vega Build an embedded software development environment where AI runs without sending code outside the company. Good fit if you Want AI in embedded development Cannot send source code outside Want the whole team using AI Learn more Services AI Model Porting and Optimization for Embedded Systems Port, optimize, and validate AI models on target embedded hardware — in a secure environment. Good fit if you Can't hit performance targets on target hardware Lose accuracy after quantization Re-port for every chip change Learn more Products Fixstars AIBooster Install on your GPU servers. AIBooster continuously profiles AI/LLM workloads, surfaces bottlenecks, and reduces GPU cost. Good fit if you Are burdened by rising AI processing and infrastructure costs Want more efficient AI development Want better ROI from existing GPU infrastructure Learn more Case Studies Optimizing Ore Blending to Improve Mine Revenue by 5–10% Industry Mining & Logistics Service area Quantum Computing Co-developing an optimization toolset for AI software on the R-Car SoC Industry Automotive Service area AI Model Optimization Large-scale Graph Analysis on the Fugaku Supercomputer Industry High-Performance Computing Service area Software Acceleration View all case studies This website uses cookies to improve your user experience on this site. By continuing to view this site, you agree to our privacy policy . I accept Fixstars Corporation 31F BLUE FRONT SHIBAURA TOWER S 1-1-1 Shibaura, Minato-ku Tokyo 105-0023, Japan +81-3-6420-0751 Mon–Fri 10am–6p",pending_chatgpt_review,,,,,,
