3,3694,OPTiM Corporation,IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,90.0,92.0,Technology,Software - Infrastructure,https://www.optim.co.jp,"OPTiM Corporation provides IoT platform, remote management, support, and other services in Japan. The company offers AI services, including OPTiM artificial intelligence (AI) Camera, an image analysis service, as well as OPTiM Physical Security service. It also operates OPTiM Store, a platform to create business app marketplace; and OPTiM Cloud IoT OS, a platform which provides management services for various devices in IoT network. In addition, the company offers Optimal Biz, which allows an IT administrator to manage IT devices in an office; Optimal Biz Secure Shield; Optimal Remote, a support tool to provide support and reduce diagnostic time, as well as a maintenance tool to control terminals located in distant places; and Optimal Second Sight, a solution for live video to be shared through a smart glass, smartphone, or tablet. Further, it provides support services, which include Optimal Diagnosis and Repair, a tool to find and repair troubles on smartphones, tablets, PCs, and routers on the network; Optimal Setup, a technology that automatically setup routers, which are available for telecommunication carriers; and Optimal Guard to prevent spoofing and information leakage by detecting, stopping, and deleting malicious executable files. Additionally, the company engages in the smart agriculture business, as well as develops and sells cloud CRM. OPTiM Corporation was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",ok,https://www.optim.co.jp | https://www.optim.co.jp/corporate/outline | https://www.optim.co.jp/business/it-department,OPTiM（オプティム）｜AIであらゆる産業の未来を創造する 顧客サポートと業務効率化の方法を、実践から学べるメディア開設 顧客サポートと業務効率化の方法を学べるメディアを開設 導入事例や業種別AI活用例など、SGP独自情報も多数公開 詳しくはこちら × OPTiM ® お役立ち情報 アクセス English 全ページ一覧 会社情報 会社情報トップ 会社案内 ディレクター紹介 拠点紹介 アクセス 沿革 事業案内 情シスAX事業 オフィスAX事業 コミュニケーションAX事業 農業AX事業 医療AX事業 建設・土木AX事業 知財戦略 知財紹介 特許一覧 グループ会社 OPTiMの強み プラットフォーム 技術力