3,3741,"Systems Engineering Consultants Co.,LTD.",IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,94.0,100.0,Technology,Software - Infrastructure,https://www.sec.co.jp,"Systems Engineering Consultants Co.,LTD., a software development company, provides real-time software solutions in mobile networking, internet technology, public infrastructure, space, robotics, and advanced technology fields in Japan. Its mobile networking business develops embedded software for various mobile devices, including smartphones and tablet PCs, mobile terminals, and in-vehicle information terminals; and internet technology business develops embedded software for contactless IC cards and other application technologies, such as IoT-related technologies; and real-time technologies, including augmented and virtual reality, mixed reality, XML technologies, and cloud systems. The company also develops public infrastructure comprising application technologies for public infrastructure fields, including advanced transportation systems, defense-related systems, location information management systems, and systems for use in medical, environmental energy, and government offices. In addition, its space, robotics, and advanced technologies business offers embedded systems for scientific satellites, planetary probes, astronomical telescopes, and data analysis systems, as well as researches and develops robots; and development and consulting services on various uses of robotic systems. Further, the company provides RTMSafety, a robot middleware; Rtino, an indoor autonomous mobile robot software; and Rtrilo, a computer vision software for robots and other machines. Systems Engineering Consultants Co.,LTD. was incorporated in 1970 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",ok,https://www.sec.co.jp | https://www.sec.co.jp/ja/sec/about.html | https://www.sec.co.jp/ja/sec/fields.html,株式会社セック －SEC－ 「社会の安全と発展のために」 CLOSE MENU mv-slider lazy: true トップ サブ-ナビゲーション セックを知る 会社情報 サステナビリティ 投資家情報 採用情報 ニュース お問い合わせ ご利用条件 個人情報保護方針 情報セキュリティ方針 トップ トピ