3,3825,"Remixpoint, Inc.",小売り,内需・消費,,unknown,42.0,42.0,Utilities,Utilities - Regulated Electric,https://www.remixpoint.co.jp,"Remixpoint, Inc. engages in the development and sale of energy management systems and energy-saving support consulting services in Japan. The company operates through four segments: Energy Business, Resilience Business, Financial Investment Business, and Others. It also provides electric power retail services, energy saving and subsidy support and consulting, energy management, and zero energy building services; and sells storage batteries for home use and infectious disease prevention products. Further, it provides antibacterial/antiviral coating, lighting strike suppression lighting, MA-T visualization of closed/dense, water dispenser, spatial environment improvement, AI face recognition and body temperature detection, and power supply. Additionally, the company offers services related to cryptocurrency investment, stock investment, and loans, as well as marketing consulting services. Remixpoint, Inc. was incorporated in 2004 and is based in Tokyo, Japan.",ok,https://www.remixpoint.co.jp | https://www.remixpoint.co.jp/about-us | https://www.remixpoint.co.jp/corporate/,"株式会社リミックスポイント | Remixpoint, Inc. Energy Solution Energy Solution Energy Solution リミックスでんき 蓄電ソリューション 補助金支援コンサルティング事業 EMSエネマネ ZEBプランナー ReafCoreX Remix Battery GROWATT Digital Asset Digital Asset Digital Asset DEEPPOINT 暗号資産ニュース About us About us About us 社長メッセージ 会社概要 経営チーム アクセス 沿革 サステナビリティ 女性活躍推進 子会社（シールエンジニアリング） News News プレスリリース お知らせ 動画ギャラリー IR IR IR情報 IRニュース 財務ハイライト IRライブラリー 株式情報 株主総会関連資料 FAQ 電子公告 免責事項 コーポレート・ガバナンス Recruit Contact English President’s Message IR information Company Overview History Address Sustainability & CSR English English President’s Message IR information Company Overview History Address Sustainability & CSR 第26回 SMART ENERGY WEEK ～スマートエネルギー WEEK～【秋】 2026年9月9日(水) - 11日(金) 10:00 - 17:00 詳細はこちら Energy × Digital Assets. Creating New Value. エネルギーとデジタルアセットを軸に