3,3907,Silicon Studio Corporation,IT関連,デジタル・サービス,,unknown,72.0,68.0,Communication Services,Electronic Gaming & Multimedia,https://www.siliconstudio.co.jp,"Silicon Studio Corporation develops game engine and middleware products in Japan and internationally. It operates through two segments, development promotion and support business and human resources business. The company offers YEBIS, an optical effects middleware; Enlighten, process global illumination in real time while minimizing the load on GPU; Mizuchi, the real-time rendering engine used in gaming and virtual reality (VR), video and animation, product and architectural visualization, etc.; Motion Portrait, a CG technology to create facial animation from a digital photo; and Enlighten, a lighting technology that delivers real-time global illumination over mobile, desktop, and VR platforms. It offers human resource services comprising development, consulting, outsourcing, and staffing, including temporary, temporary-to-permanent, and full-time placement services. In addition, it offers various solutions comprising training image solutions for machine learning; game engine use in the industrial field; 3D digital twin/industrial metaverse; urban space visualization; design review solution; driving simulator compatible solution; digital twin solutions using point clouds and photogrammetry; online, cloud development solutions; and game development environment construction support. The company was incorporated in 1999 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",ok,https://www.siliconstudio.co.jp | https://www.siliconstudio.co.jp/products-service/ | https://www.siliconstudio.co.jp/corporate/,"シリコンスタジオ ― Silicon Studio ― お問い合わせ メニュー 製品・ソリューション ⼈材紹介・派遣 コンテンツ制作 研究開発 企業情報 企業情報 一覧を見る 一覧 会社概要 コンセプト 事業概要 関連会社 アクセスマップ 沿革 公式SNSについて IR情報 IR情報 一覧を見る 一覧 経営情報 財務情報 IRライブラリ 株式情報 その他IR情報 IRニュース ニュース ニュース 新着情報一覧を見る 一覧 ニュースリリース メディア掲載情報 イベント情報 採用情報 日本語 / English English お問い合わせはこちら フィジカルAI事業を本格始動 3DCG技術とNVIDIA Omniverse等を活用し、 製造業・自動車・ロボティク